{"server":"cn","storyId":"act30side_level_act30side_02_beg","groupId":"act30side","stageId":"act30side_02","title":"同车异图","storyCode":"RS-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"171089ad9882a39dab9be98943e408dd868471fecf3f8a2bec4acd8bfda09ec3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g3_traincarriage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就是说那个蜂蜜饮料啊，喝起来甜滋滋的，没想到后劲大得很！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过对我来说也就一般般啦，我朋友还说我醉蜜，结果呢，我精神得很，她倒是先倒下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？喂喂，大叔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——你在听吗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恕我失礼，罗莎琳，你刚刚说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说我朋友醉蜜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是的是的，没错，醉蜜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，真麻烦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔你要是有什么在意的事，就先去解决一下呗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这副魂不守舍的样子，根本没法聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，现在可没有什么比罗莎琳你的故事更值得我在意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续说说醉蜜的事吧，罗莎琳，我记得列车上应该也有卖含蜂蜜的特产饮料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，少骗人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这双眼睛利着呢，从刚刚那个戴帽子的家伙来开始，大叔你就不太对劲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是朋友......不对，我看不像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是仇人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这倒也称不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许用“同僚”勉强能概括我与那位先生的关系，尽管我们在“公司”内并非隶属同一部门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，那就是休假时撞见关系不怎么样的同事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜欢这个说法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，罗莎琳，我承认我有点担心我的同僚能否顺利完成他的工作，所以，原谅我要失陪一会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为补偿，我会给你带蜂蜜饮料，主要原料是谢拉格特产高地蜂蜜，每一滴都是耶拉冈德的恩赐，天然纯净......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？但我已经要对这套耶拉冈德广告词无感了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千真万确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你的朋友说你会醉蜜，我想我们需要做个约定——每天最多一瓶，以防你在旅行期间真的喝醉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之间没有如此剑拔弩张的必要，锏女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵阁下心系喀兰贸易，同时也关注谢拉格的发展，为其留意谢拉格的方方面面，是我的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次自然也不例外，您不必如此防范。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的工作，包括参观列车的包厢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的变化惊人，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据我所知，这条从圣山脚下到银心湖的线路上，投入使用的列车都是自维多利亚引进的车型。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过这一系列与当初引进时相比，已经有了很大的变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只用短短三年时间就能够做到这一步，喀兰贸易在技术上的发展，令最早在此事上牵线的公爵阁下也颇为赞叹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺希斯如果做不到，那为他力排众议的恩希欧迪斯就该头疼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算和我聊聊技术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你找错人了，直接去找诺希斯聊，搞不好他还会有点兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我很好奇，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没想到会在这里遇见您，还是在这样的情况下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什么人值得您亲自出手？是多么棘手的状况，能让您急迫到......没有时间更换一双沾满血污的手套？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解决了一点小麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劝你收起不合时宜的好奇心，“灰礼帽”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是来找人的，暂时还不想再弄脏一双手套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无意冒犯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我绝无干涉锏女士行动的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，想必在车上的一定是位重要人物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您不介意透露些许，或许我能为您效劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟“寻人”......这也算是我们的日常工作之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像搞错了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希欧迪斯默许你们在他身边探头探脑，那是他的事，我不会管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我没那么好的耐心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道谢拉格比卡西米尔好在哪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里冷是冷了点，相对的，虫子就少一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些让人心烦的飞虫，总是让人有伸手碾死的冲动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收敛点，否则，我不介意替恩希欧迪斯动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多谢忠告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，废话够多了。你拖够时间了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很巧，我要找的就是刚刚在车厢门后面偷听的那位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏女士——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一道森冷白光在他的话说完前自眼前掠过。\n“灰礼帽”的阻拦被压回腹中，他头顶标志性礼帽的帽檐无声裂开，躲藏在伪装之下的公爵密探终于露出惊惧的一角。\n女人的手状似随意地搭在锏上。她的目光让“灰礼帽”清晰地意识到——\n此刻，自己正是猛兽眼中的猎物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是很想让这辆列车报废。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别让我说第二次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者你想躺下让路，也可以。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（开玩笑吧？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（黑骑士，真是......如果是在卡西米尔，手上沾血的黑骑士可是能被印成珍稀隐藏闪卡的！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不光是“灰礼帽”，现在连黑骑士都出现在这趟列车上......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，还要加上我——一位维多利亚子爵，被黑骑士点名要找的重要人物。这真是群星荟萃！了不起！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我需要现在立刻有人来告诉我这是即兴娱乐，是个玩笑......我很需要！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里斯本？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你现在立刻去确认喀兰贸易有没有异动——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不对，先确认我们的人是否安全！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们的人？在营地的都没问题，送你去车站后我们正常返回，没有遭遇什么异常情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过杰弗逊他们拼酒还没回来......我现在就让人联系他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，哈洛德，听你的语气，出状况了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时没事。暂时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿是我想太多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，先确认杰弗逊他们现在的状态，让他们立刻汇报！就算是醉死了，也给我爬起来应一声再死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老练的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......行，我立刻办。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉冈德在上，如果真像谢拉格人说的那样，耶拉冈德无所不知，无处不在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看，现在就是您该显显灵的时候啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别把一个诚心的观光客往外推呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一最后做不成好客人，那我可就只能当个不受欢迎的恶客咯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前就是这样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里信号有点问题，我试了下，车厢里基本上接不到通讯，走道上还稍微好点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好之前拜托极光她们做了点准备，要不然估计还联系不上你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能有什么事？放心，我好得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！本舰就交给你们联系，帮我和其他人也问声好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就这样，先挂了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样应该就没问题了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是你啊大叔，吓了我一跳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在跑什么？躲谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉，不过现在不是说这个的好时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳，你怎么不待在包厢里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我出来透透气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦没有，透透气当然没有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可惜，看来没有多少解释的时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳，你先回包厢——不，等等，不行，“灰礼帽”那家伙已经见过你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（而且，那家伙说的“眼熟”......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰礼帽”？是说刚刚你那个戴帽子的同事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，没错，就是他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我遇到一些小麻烦，罗莎琳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提前申明，将你卷入其中绝非我的本意，只不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不在，让一些奇怪的人找到机会和你搭讪就不好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？搭讪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那种无聊的人别理就行了，要是还敢纠缠不休，就照着鼻子给他一拳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错的办法，之后有机会请务必这样做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过总有些就算挨年轻女士的拳头，也不会轻易退却的难缠的家伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我想邀请你，罗莎琳。要不要一起去最前方的餐车，品尝蜂蜜饮料，顺便回避一些缠人的搭讪者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你的意思是，一起去整点蜂蜜饮料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我们去整点蜂蜜饮料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是还要一路跑过去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是的，一路跑过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，大叔，后面追你的人快过来了吧，我都听到脚步声了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还真是一点都不遮掩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过的，我不对女士说谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊，虽然不知道你们在闹什么名堂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但好像挺有意思的，我跟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荣幸之至。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么事不宜迟——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，立刻，让我们跑起来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
